{"id":"b3592c20d8a8ef2e","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Smooth System","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system — ZFC Pcf2 Smooth System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system — ZFC Pcf2 Smooth System","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf2-generator.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system — ZFC Pcf2 Smooth System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4482f7b67f48709\" href=\"?note=d4482f7b67f48709\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf2-generator.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf2-generator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,P,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(A,P,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is the explicitly supplied possible-cofinality index set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Generator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Generator}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,P,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land |A|&lt;\\min(A)\n\\land P\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal B,P,\\mathcal P(A))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Generator}_S(A,\\lambda,\\mathcal B(\\lambda))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\\forall\\mu\\in P\\cap\\mathcal B(\\lambda)\\;\n(\\mathcal B(\\mu)\\subseteq\\mathcal B(\\lambda)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,P,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land |A|&lt;\\min(A)\n\\land P\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal B,P,\\mathcal P(A))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Generator}_S(A,\\lambda,\\mathcal B(\\lambda))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\\forall\\mu\\in P\\cap\\mathcal B(\\lambda)\\;\n(\\mathcal B(\\mu)\\subseteq\\mathcal B(\\lambda)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The possible-cofinality set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is an explicit argument, so the definition does not apply an unavailable class-level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> operator. Smoothness is required exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in P\\cap B_\\lambda\">\\(\\mu\\in P\\cap B_\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf2-generator.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4482f7b67f48709","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf2-generator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,P,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Generator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,P,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land |A|<\\min(A)\n\\land P\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal B,P,\\mathcal P(A))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Generator}_S(A,\\lambda,\\mathcal B(\\lambda))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in P\\;\\forall\\mu\\in P\\cap\\mathcal B(\\lambda)\\;\n(\\mathcal B(\\mu)\\subseteq\\mathcal B(\\lambda)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\in P\\cap B_\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1576,"backlinks":[{"id":"495beb1615196027","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3056","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system.md|58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["d4482f7b67f48709","0fbfc19800246e77","36d7463d215be751"]}